            explanationEn: 'One of Skinner\'s central contributions. He proved in the laboratory that a reward on a variable schedule, arriving at random, is stronger than a fixed reward. The brain does not know when the next reward will arrive, so it keeps trying, and keeps going, and keeps going. This is the same principle that works in gambling, in video games, and yes, in social networks',
