            quoteEn: '"This book is concerned with one problem only: the ways and means by which the ego wards off unpleasure and anxiety, and exercises control over impulsive behavior, affects and instinctive urges."',
            attr: 'אנה פרויד, "האני ומנגנוני ההגנה", 1936',
